++++++  `test_movement`; the ranking helpers `is_test` and `is_entry_point` are
++++++  untouched.
++++++- Config files (`*.toml`, `*.yaml`, `*.json`) that are neither docs nor source:
++++++  their existing treatment as substantive is unchanged.
